It stars Riz Ahmed, Cush Jumbo, James Floyd, Billie Piper and Roshan Seth.

12
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Set in London, it tells the story of a private detective who
investigates the disappearance of a Russian prostitute.

13
